      "message": "[warning] Line 78: 🟡 The generated debug `libpjproject.pc` sets `prefix\u003d${pcfiledir}/../..`, which resolves to `\u003cpackage\u003e/debug`, so `includedir\u003d${prefix}/include` points to `\u003cpackage\u003e/debug/include` (typically absent in vcpkg ports). This can break debug consumers that read include flags from pkg-config. Use a root-relative prefix for debug (e.g. `${pcfiledir}/../../..`) or set `includedir` explicitly to the non-debug include dir.",
